# A face of the solid neither flat nor round, a side of a loft from a
# circle to a square, picked on the model and named "side" on the
# datums screen; the same as path_datum_freeform.go makes
# (TestPathEquivalenceDatumFreeForm).
file $testdata/solid/loft-circle-to-square.tlspr
menu File|Open...
view rotated
menu View|Zoom To Fit
move 400 300
down L 400 300
up L 400 300
menu Edit|Datums...
tw
twmove 100 130
twdown L 100 130
twup L 100 130
edit side
tw
